{% doc %}
  Biotaderm — Two-Week Trial line and the member login prompt.

  The login prompt must NOT name either scheme. It renders to logged-OUT
  visitors, so naming the Founders Club there would advertise a closed,
  retrospective scheme - twenty per cent for the seventeen customers who bought
  before 11 August 2026 - to people who can never join it. "Founders Club" must
  not appear anywhere on the public site.

  The order confirmation email and the thank-you extension are a different
  case: both are gated on membership, so they name the scheme correctly and are
  left alone.

  The wording also has to carry two schemes at once - Founders Club members,
  and Opening Offer customers, who are segmented automatically and must equally
  be logged in to redeem. Hence "member", naming neither.

  @param {string} part - 'trial' renders the line above the checkout button.
                         'login' renders the member prompt below it.
{% enddoc %}

{%- if part == 'trial' -%}
  {%- unless cart.empty? -%}
    <p class="bd-trial-line">
      <span class="bd-trial-line__lead">Two-Week Trial.</span>
      Give it a fortnight. If it's not right, swap it or send it back, return postage paid.
    </p>
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if part == 'login' -%}
  {%- if customer == null -%}
    <p class="bd-login-prompt">
      Already a member?
      <a href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}?return_url={{ routes.cart_url }}">Log in so your discount applies.</a>
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .bd-trial-line {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: var(--font-size--sm);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .bd-trial-line__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-subheading--family, inherit);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--font-size--sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #161617;
  }

  .bd-login-prompt {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--font-size--xs);
    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / var(--opacity-subdued-text));
  }

  .bd-login-prompt a {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
